{"term": {"label": "心", "occurrences": 1, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "5A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-i", "title": "萬章上", "description": "萬章問曰：「舜往于田，號泣于旻天，何為其號泣也？」\n孟子曰：「怨慕也。」\n萬章曰：「父母愛之，喜而不忘；父母惡之，勞而不怨。然則舜怨乎？」\n曰：「長息問於公明高曰：『舜往于田，則吾既得聞命矣；號泣于旻天，于父母，則吾不知也。』公明高曰：『是非爾所知也。』夫公明高以孝子之心，為不若是恝，我竭力耕田，共為子職而已矣，父母之"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "孝", "id": "孝"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "慕", "id": "慕"}, {"form": "歌", "id": "歌"}, {"form": "母", "id": "母"}, {"form": "父", "id": "父"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "莫", "id": "莫"}, {"form": "薦", "id": "薦"}, {"form": "親", "id": "親"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}, {"form": "諸", "id": "諸"}, {"form": "謳", "id": "謳"}, {"form": "賢", "id": "賢"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.2966822024302034, "source": "孝", "target": "子"}, {"weight": 4.1588830833596715, "source": "孝", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 2.772588722239781, "source": "孝", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 2.2129729343043585, "source": "孝", "target": "慕"}, {"weight": 1.519825753744413, "source": "孝", "target": "母"}, {"weight": 1.3256697393034558, "source": "孝", "target": "父"}, {"weight": 2.2129729343043585, "source": "孝", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 2.0794415416798357, "source": "孝", "target": "莫"}, {"weight": 2.367123614131617, "source": "孝", "target": "親"}, {"weight": 2.2129729343043585, "source": "孝", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 1.2966822024302034, "source": "賢", "target": "子"}, {"weight": 1.6533571463689358, "source": "慕", "target": "母"}, {"weight": 1.4592011319279783, "source": "慕", "target": "父"}, {"weight": 0.04391923393483558, "source": "慕", "target": "子"}, {"weight": 2.2129729343043585, "source": "慕", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 1.9898293829901488, "source": "心", "target": "子"}, {"weight": 1.0090001299784226, "source": "諸", "target": "子"}, {"weight": 2.0794415416798357, "source": "諸", "target": "薦"}, {"weight": 2.0794415416798357, "source": "諸", "target": 